hadiths[68]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1601","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein khabar di, Lais se, Ibn Shihab se, Ata bin Yazid Laisi se, Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar se, Miqdad se: Unhon ne use khabar di ke unhon ne farmaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, farmayen agar main kafiron mein se ek aadmi se milun aur woh mujh se lade aur meri ek hath talwar se maar kar kaat de phir mujh se darakht ki panah le, aur kahe: Main Allah ke liye Islam laya, to kya main use qatl kar dun aye Allah ke Rasool us ke kehne ke baad? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use qatl na karo. To main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, us ne mera hath kata hai, phir us ne us ke katne ke baad yeh kaha, to kya main use qatl kar dun? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use qatl na karo; kyunke woh tumhare martabe mein hai us se pehle ke tum use qatl karo, aur tum us ke martabe mein ho us se pehle ke woh apna kalima kahe jo us ne kaha."
"1602","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ata bin Yazid Laisi se, Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar se: Ek aadmi ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sargoshi ki; hum na jante the us ne Aap se kya sargoshi ki yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne buland awaz se farmaya. Phir woh munafiqeen mein se ek aadmi ke qatl mein Aap se mashwara kar raha tha. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya woh gawahi nahin deta ke Allah ke siva koi mabood nahin? Unhon ne kaha: Han, aur us ke liye koi gawahi nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Kya woh namaz nahin padhta? Unhon ne kaha: Han, aur us ke liye koi namaz nahin. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yahi woh hain jin se Allah ne mujhe mana farmaya hai."
"1603","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Usamah bin Zaid se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Abdullah bin Ubayy ke nifaq ki teen majlison mein hazir tha. Pehli Kitab Jirahul Amd se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1604","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Sabit bin Zahhak se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni jaan ko duniya mein kisi cheez se qatl kare, use Qiyamat ke din usi se azab diya jayega. Kitab Jirahul Amd se nikali."
"1605","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Siqah ne hamein khabar di, Hammad se, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Umamah bin Sahl bin Hunaif se, Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ka qatl halal nahin magar teen mein se ek se: iman ke baad kufr, ihsan ke baad zina, ya jaan ke badle jaan ke qatl."
"1606","[AI-translation] Siqah ne, aur woh Yahya bin Hassan hain, hamein khabar di, Hammad se, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Abu Umamah bin Sahl se, Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman ka khoon halal nahin magar teen mein se ek se: iman ke baad kufr, ihsan ke baad zina, ya jaan ke badle jaan ke qatl."
"1607","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Zaid bin Aslam se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apna deen badle us ki gardan maar do. Pehli Kitab Jirahul Amd se, doosri Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees se, aur teesri Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1608","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdur Rahman bin Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abd Qari se, apne walid se: Unhon ne farmaya: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas Abu Musa ki taraf se ek aadmi aaya. To unhon ne us se logon ke bare mein poocha, to us ne unhein khabar di. Phir farmaya: Kya tum mein door ki koi khabar thi? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Ek aadmi apne Islam ke baad kafir ho gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum ne us ke sath kya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Hum ne use qareeb kiya aur us ki gardan maari, to Umar ne farmaya: Tum ne use teen din qaid kyun na kiya aur use har din ek roti khilate aur use tauba karate, shayad woh tauba karta aur Allah ke hukm ki taraf lautta. Aye Allah, main hazir na tha aur na razi hua aur na hukm diya jab mujhe pahunchi. Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se nikali."
"1609","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Talhah bin Abdullah bin Auf se, Sa'id bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jaye woh shaheed hai."
"1610","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Talhah bin Abdullah bin Auf se, Sa'id bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jaye woh shaheed hai. Pehli Kitab Jirahul Amd se aur doosri Kitab Qital Ahlil Baghyi se nikali."
"1611","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne paanch ya saat aadmiyon ko ek aadmi ke badle qatl kiya jise unhon ne dhoke se qatl kiya tha, aur Umar ne farmaya: Agar Ahl Sana us par jama hote to main un sab ko qatl karta. Kitab Jirahul Amd se nikali."
"1612","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein apni kitab mein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein bataya, Amr bin Dinar se: Unhon ne Bajalah ko kehte suna: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne likha: Har jadoogar mard aur aurat ko qatl kar do. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir hum ne teen jadoogarniyon ko qatl kiya."
"1613","[AI-translation] Unhon ne farmaya: Aur hamein khabar di: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja Hafsah ne apni ek laundi ko qatl kiya jis ne un par jadoo kiya tha."
"1614","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne hamein apni kitab mein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aye Aishah, kya tum nahin janti ke Allah Ta'ala ne mujhe us mamle mein fatwa diya jis mein main ne us se fatwa manga tha. Aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) itne aur itne thehre, Aap ko khayal hota ke woh aurton ke paas aate hain jabke woh un ke paas nahin aate the, mere paas do aadmi aaye; un mein se ek mere qadmon ke paas baitha, aur doosra mere sir ke paas, to jo mere qadmon ke paas tha us ne jo mere sir ke paas tha us se kaha: Is aadmi ka kya haal hai? Unhon ne kaha: Use jadoo kiya gaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur use kis ne jadoo kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Labeed bin A'sam ne. Unhon ne kaha: Aur kis mein? Unhon ne kaha: Khajoor ke nar khoshe ke khol mein, kanghi aur kate balon mein, kunwen ke pathar ya chamde ke neeche, Rabi' ko shak hua, Bir Zarwan mein. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us ke paas aaye. To Aap ne farmaya: Yeh woh hai jo mujhe dikhayi gayi thi, goya us ki khajooron ke sire shaitanon ke siron jaise hain, aur goya us ka pani mehndi ke sharbat jaisa hai. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ka hukm farmaya aur use nikala gaya. Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Phir main ne kaha aye Allah ke Rasool, to kyun nahin, Sufyan ne farmaya, yani: Aap ne nashrah karaya, Aishah ne farmaya: To Aap ne farmaya: Raha Allah, to us ne mujhe shifa de di hai, aur main napasand karta hun ke logon par is se shar uthaaun. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur Labeed bin A'sam Banu Zuraiq mein se ek aadmi hai, Yahood ka haleef. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Ta'am wash Sharab wa Imaratil Aradeen mein se, us mein se jo Rabi' ne Shafi'i se nahin suna."
"1615","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Suhaib maula Abdullah bin Aamir se, Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chidiya ya us se upar ko baghair haq qatl kare, Allah Azza wa Jalla us se us ke qatl ke bare mein poochega. Kaha gaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, aur us ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ke woh use zibah kare aur khaye, aur us ka sir na kate aur use phenk de."
"1616","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub bin Abi Tamimah se, Ikrimah se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab Ibn Abbas ko pahunchi ke Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne murtaddon ya zindeeqon ko jalaya, to unhon ne farmaya: Agar main hota to main unhein na jalata aur unhein qatl karta; Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman ki wajah se: Jo apna deen badle use qatl kar do. Aur main unhein na jalata; Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman ki wajah se: Kisi ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh Allah ke azab se azab de."
"1617","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se: Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Ibn Muljam ke bare mein us ke marne ke baad farmaya: Use khilao aur pilao aur us ki qaid achhi rakho, agar main zinda raha to main apne khoon ka wali hun, chaahun to muaf karun, aur chaahun to qisas lun, aur agar main mar jaun aur tum use qatl karo to musla na karo. Pehli Kitab Qitalul Mushrikeen se, doosri Kitab Asra wal Ghulool se, aur teesri Kitab Qital Ahlil Baghyi se nikali."
"1618","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki talwar ke dastay mein ek kitab payi gayi: Logon mein Allah Subhanahu wa Ta'ala par sab se zyada dushman qatil hai jo apne qatil ke siva ko qatl kare, aur marne wala jo apne marne wale ke siva ko mare, aur jo apne maulon ke siva ko wali banaye woh us ka inkar karne wala hai jo Allah Subhanahu ne Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil farmaya."
"1619","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abu Ja'far Muhammad bin Ali se kaha: Us saheefe mein kya tha jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki miyan mein tha? To unhon ne farmaya: Us mein tha: Allah lanat kare qatil par jo apne qatil ke siva ko qatl kare, aur marne wale par jo apne marne wale ke siva ko mare, aur jo apne ne'mat ke wali ke siva ko wali banaye woh us ka inkar karne wala hai jo Allah Ta'ala ne Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nazil farmaya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Jirahul Amd se nikali."
"1620","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Amr bin Aus se, unhon ne farmaya: Aadmi doosre ke gunah mein pakda jata tha, yahan tak ke Ibrahim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaye. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Aur Ibrahim jis ne wafa ki; ke koi bojh uthane wala doosre ka bojh nahin uthayega (An-Najm: 37-38)."
"1621","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Abdul Malik bin Sa'id bin Abjar se, Iyad bin Laqit se, Abu Rimsah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main apne walid ke sath Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua. To mere walid ne jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki pusht par tha dekha. To unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe chhoden main aap ki pusht ka ilaj karun kyunke main tabeeb hun. Aap ne farmaya: Tum rafeeq ho. Aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh tumhare sath kaun hai? To unhon ne farmaya: Mera beta. Aap ne farmaya: Use gawah banao. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardar, woh tum par zulm nahin karega aur tum us par zulm nahin karoge. Pehli Kitab Ahkamul Quran se aur doosri Kitab Jirahul Amd se nikali."
"1622","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad bin Hasan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein bataya, Muhammad bin Munkadir se, Abdur Rahman bin Bailamani se: Musalmanon mein se ek aadmi ne zimmi gharon mein se ek aadmi ko qatl kiya. To yeh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas uthaya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Main apni zimma wafa karne ka sab se zyada haqdar hun. Phir us ka hukm farmaya aur use qatl kiya gaya."
"1623","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Hasan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Qais bin Rabi' Asadi ne hamein khabar di, Aban bin Taghlib se, Hasan bin Maimoon se, Abdullah bin Abdullah maula Bani Hashim se, Abul Junub Asadi se, unhon ne farmaya: Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas Musalmanon mein se ek aadmi laya gaya jis ne zimmi gharon mein se ek aadmi ko qatl kiya tha. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir us par daleel qayam hui aur unhon ne us ke qatl ka hukm farmaya. Phir us ka bhai aaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne muaf kar diya hai. To unhon ne farmaya: Shayad unhon ne tumhein dhamkaya ya alag kiya ya daraya. Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, lekin us ka qatl mere bhai ko mujhe wapas nahin karega; us ne mujhe muawza diya aur main razi ho gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Tum zyada jante ho. Jis ki hamari zimma ho us ka khoon hamare khoon jaisa hai aur us ki diyat hamari diyat jaisi hai. Dono hadeesein Kitab Diyat wal Qisas se nikali."
"1624","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Husain se, Ata se, Tawus se, mera khayal hai unhon ne farmaya, aur Mujahid se, aur Hasan se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fath ke din farmaya: Koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega."
"1625","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Mutarrif se, Sha'bi se, Abu Juhaifah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: Kya tumhare paas Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Quran ke siva kuch hai? To unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, Qasam us Zaat ki jis ne dana cheera aur jaan banayi; magar Allah Ta'ala bande ko apni kitab mein samajh ata farmaye aur jo saheefe mein hai. Main ne kaha: Aur saheefe mein kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Aql, qaidi chhudana, aur koi Musalman kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega. Aur doosri jagah: Koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega."
"1626","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Mutarrif se, Sha'bi se, Abu Juhaifah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ali se poocha: Kya tumhare paas Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Quran ke siva kuch hai? To unhon ne farmaya: Nahin, Qasam us Zaat ki jis ne dana cheera aur jaan banayi; magar bande ko Quran mein samajh di jaye aur jo saheefe mein hai. Main ne kaha: Aur saheefe mein kya hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Aql, qaidi chhudana, aur koi momin kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega."
"1627","[AI-translation] Muslim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Husain se, Ata se, Tawus, Mujahid, aur Hasan se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fath ke saal apne khutbe mein farmaya: Koi Musalman kafir ke badle qatl nahin kiya jayega. Unhon ne farmaya: Yeh mursal hai. Main ne kaha: Han."
"1628","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Hasan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad bin Zaid ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Husain ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se: Ibn Shas Juzami ne Shaam ke Nabt mein se ek aadmi ko qatl kiya. To yeh Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas uthaya gaya. To unhon ne us ke qatl ka hukm farmaya. To Zubair aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se logon ne un se baat ki aur unhein us ke qatl se mana kiya. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir unhon ne us ki diyat ek hazaar deenar muqarrar ki."
"1629","[AI-translation] Aur usi se Zuhri se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, unhon ne farmaya: Apne ahd mein har mu'ahid ki diyat ek hazaar deenar hai. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, teesri Kitab Jirahul Amd se, aur chhathi ke aakhir tak Kitab Diyat wal Qisas se nikali."
"1630","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muhammad bin Ismail bin Abi Fudaik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Sa'id bin Abi Sa'id Maqburi se, Abu Shuraih Ka'bi se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka maqtool qatl kiya jaye to us ke ghar wale do ikhtiyar ke darmiyan hain: agar woh chahen un ke liye aql hai; aur agar woh chahen to un ke liye qawad hai."
"1631","[AI-translation] Siqah ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar se, Yahya bin Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah ya usi mani ki tarah."
"1632","[AI-translation] Abu Hanifah, Simak bin Fazl ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ibn Abi Zi'b ne Maqburi se hadees bayan ki, Abu Shuraih Ka'bi se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fath ke saal farmaya: Jis ka maqtool qatl kiya jaye to woh do behtar nazar ke darmiyan hai: agar chahe aql le, aur agar chahe to us ke liye qawad hai. To Abu Hanifah ne farmaya: Phir main ne Ibn Abi Zi'b se kaha: Kya tum is par amal karte ho aye Abul Haris? To unhon ne mera seena mara, mujh par bahut cheekhe, aur mujh se bura kaha. Aur farmaya: Main tumhein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees bayan karta hun aur tum kehte ho: Kya tum is par amal karte ho. Han, main is par amal karta hun aur woh mujh par aur us par farz hai jis ne use suna. Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko logon mein se muntakhib farmaya aur unhein un ke zariye hidayat di, un ke haathon par, aur un ke liye woh muntakhib farmaya jo un ke liye muntakhib farmaya, un ki zaban par. Pas makhlooq par hai ke woh un ki pairwi karen farmanbardar ya aajiz hokar; kisi Musalman ke liye is se nikalne ki gunjaish nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Woh mujh se khamosh na hue yahan tak ke main ne tamanna ki ke woh khamosh ho jayen."
"1633","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ismail bin Abi Fudaik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Sa'id Maqburi se, Abu Shuraih Ka'bi se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne Makkah ko haram farmaya hai aur logon ne use haram nahin farmaya. Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai us ke liye halal nahin ke woh wahan khoon bahaye aur na wahan darakht kate. Phir agar koi rukhsat mange, aur kahe: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye halal ki gayi thi. To Allah ne use mere liye halal farmaya aur logon ke liye halal nahin farmaya; aur woh mere liye sirf din ki ek ghadi halal ki gayi thi. Phir woh haram hai jaise kal us ki hurmat thi. Phir tum aye Khuza'ah, tum ne Huzail mein se is maqtool ko qatl kiya hai; aur main Allah ki qasam us ki aql dunga. Jo us ke baad maqtool qatl kare to us ke ghar wale do ikhtiyar ke darmiyan hain; agar woh chahen qatl karen, aur agar woh chahen aql len."
"1634","[AI-translation] Mu'az bin Musa ne hamein khabar di, Bukair bin Ma'roof se, Muqatil bin Hayyan se. Muqatil ne farmaya: Main ne yeh tafseer chand logon se li; Mu'az ne un mein se Mujahid aur Hasan aur Zahhak bin Muzahim ko yaad rakha, Allah Tabaraka wa Ta'ala ke farman ke bare mein: Phir jis ke liye us ke bhai ki taraf se kuch muaf kiya jaye to maroof ke sath pairwi hai (Al-Baqarah: 178), ayat. Unhon ne farmaya: Ahl Taurat par tha: Jo jaan ko baghair jaan ke qatl kare woh us ke badle qisas diya jayega; us se muaf nahin kiya jayega aur na us se diyat qubool ki jayegi. Aur Ahl Injeel par farz tha ke us se muaf kiya jaye aur use qatl na kiya jaye. Aur Ummat Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko rukhsat di gayi: agar chahe qatl kare, aur agar chahe diyat le, aur agar chahe muaf kare. To wahi Allah Ta'ala ka farman hai: Yeh tumhare Rabb ki taraf se takhfeef aur rehmat hai (Al-Baqarah: 178). Woh kehte hain: Diyat Allah Ta'ala ki taraf se takhfeef hai jab us ne diyat banayi aur qatl na kiya jaye. Phir farmaya: Phir jo is ke baad zyadati kare to us ke liye dardnak azab hai (Al-Baqarah: 178). Aur us ke farman ke bare mein: Aur tumhare liye qisas mein zindagi hai (Al-Baqarah: 179): Tum mein se baaz baaz se rukte hain qatl kiye jane ke dar se."
"1635","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Hamein Amr bin Dinar ne khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Mujahid ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Bani Israil mein qisas tha aur un mein diyat na thi. To Allah Tabaraka wa Ta'ala ne is ummat se farmaya: Tum par maqtoolon mein qisas farz kiya gaya hai: aazad aazad ke badle aur ghulam ghulam ke badle aur aurat aurat ke badle. Phir jis ke liye us ke bhai ki taraf se kuch muaf kiya jaye to maroof ke sath pairwi aur us ki taraf ehsan ke sath ada hai. Yeh tumhare Rabb ki taraf se takhfeef aur rehmat hai (Al-Baqarah: 178), us mein se jo tum se pehlon par farz kiya gaya tha. Phir jo is ke baad zyadati kare to us ke liye dardnak azab hai (Al-Baqarah: 178). Dono hadeesein Kitab Diyat wal Qisas se aur teesri Kitab Risalah se, aur chhathi ke aakhir tak Kitab Jirahul Amd se nikali."
"1636","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Laila se, Hakam se, ya Isa bin Abi Laila se, Abu Laila se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo momin ko qatl par gussa kare to woh us ke hath ka qawad hai, magar maqtool ka wali razi ho jaye. Jo us ke darmiyan hail ho us par Allah ki lanat aur us ka gussa hai; us se sarf aur na adl qubool kiya jayega."
"1637","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ali bin Zaid bin Jud'an se, Qasim bin Rabi'ah se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar, kode ya lathi se amd khata ke maqtool mein mughallazah sau oont hain, un mein se chalis khilfah hain jin ke peton mein un ke bachche hain."
"1638","[AI-translation] Saqafi ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub Saqafi se, Khalid Hazza se, Qasim bin Rabi'ah se, Uqbah bin Aus se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi se usi ki tarah."
"1639","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Tawus se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: Aap ne farmaya: Jo ummiyah mein qatl kiya jaye, un ke darmiyan patharon se phenkna ho ya kode se marna ho ya lathi se marna ho, woh khata hai; us ki aql khata ki aql hai. Aur jo amd qatl kiya jaye to woh us ke hath ka qawad hai. Jo us ke darmiyan hail ho us par Allah ki lanat aur us ka gussa hai; us se sarf aur na adl qubool kiya jayega."
"1640","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ali bin Zaid bin Jud'an se, Qasim bin Rabi'ah se, Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar, kode aur lathi se amd khata ke qatl mein mughallazah sau oont hain, un mein se chalis khilfah hain jin ke peton mein un ke bachche hain. Yeh teen hadeesein Kitab Jirahul Amd se, aur chauthi aur paanchwin Kitab Diyat wal Qisas se nikali."
"1641","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mutarrif ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar se, Zuhri se, Urwah se, unhon ne farmaya: Abu Huzaifah bin Yaman bade budhe the. To woh Uhud ke din aurton ke sath aatam mein chadhaye gaye. Phir woh shahadat ki tamanna mein nikle. Phir woh mushrikeen ki taraf se aaye. To Musalman un ki taraf lapke aur unhein apni talwaron se mara, aur Huzaifah kehte the: Mere abba, mere abba, woh jang ki mashghooliyat se nahin sunte the, yahan tak ke unhon ne unhein qatl kar diya. To Huzaifah ne farmaya: Allah tumhein bakhshe; woh sab se zyada rehem karne wala hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki diyat ka faisla farmaya."
"1642","[AI-translation] Marwan ne hamein khabar di, Ismail bin Abi Khalid se, Qais bin Abi Hazim se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek qaum Ja'sham ki panah mein aayi. Jab Musalman un par ghalib aaye, unhon ne sajde se panah mangi. To unhon ne un mein se baaz ko qatl kiya. To yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhein un ki namaz ki wajah se aadhi aql do. Phir Aap ne us waqt farmaya: Khabardar, main har us Musalman se bari hun jo mushrik ke sath hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kyun? Aap ne farmaya: Un dono ki aag ek doosre ko nazar na aaye. Dono hadeesein Kitab Jirahul Amd se nikali."
"1643","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, apne walid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Us kitab mein jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ke liye likhi: Jaan mein sau oont."
"1644","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, diyaton ke bare mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki kitab Amr bin Hazm ke liye: Jaan mein sau oont. Ibn Juraij ne farmaya: Phir main ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se kaha: Kya tum shak mein ho ke woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ki kitab se hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Nahin."
"1645","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Tawus se, apne walid se, yani us se. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Jirahul Khata se, aur woh us mein sab se pehli hain."
"1646","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Amr bin Shuaib se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) basti walon par oonton ki qeemat chaar sau deenar ya us ke barabar chandi lagate the, aur use oonton ki qeematon par taqseem karte. Phir jab woh mehenge hote to us ki qeemat mein izafa karte, aur jab saste hote to basti walon par us ki qeemat mein se kami karte, qeemat jo bhi hoti."
"1647","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Ayyub bin Musa se, Ibn Shihab se, Makhul aur Ata se, un dono ne farmaya: Hum ne logon ko paya is par ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke daur mein aazad Musalman ki diyat sau oont thi. Phir Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne us diyat ki basti walon par qeemat ek hazaar deenar ya barah hazaar dirham lagayi. Aur aazad Musalman aurat ki diyat jab woh basti walon mein se ho paanch sau deenar ya chhe hazaar dirham. Phir agar use pahunchane wala dehatiyon mein se ho to us ki diyat pachaas oont; dehati aurat ki diyat jab use dehati pahunchaye pachaas oont. Dehati ko sona aur na chandi ka mukallaf nahin banaya jayega. Dono hadeesein Kitab Jirahul Khata se nikali."
"1648","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Lais bin Sa'd ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Lihyan ki ek aurat ke janeen ke bare mein jo murda gira tha, ghulam ya laundi ke ghurran ka faisla farmaya. Phir unhon ne farmaya: Woh aurat jis par ghurran ka faisla kiya gaya tha fout ho gayi. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke us ki virasat us ke do beton aur us ke shohar ke liye hai, aur aql us ke asbah par hai."
"1649","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Agar koi kehne wala kahe: Us khabar ka kya hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne janeen ka aaqilah par faisla farmaya? Kaha jayega: Hamein siqah ne khabar di, Rabi' ne farmaya: Aur woh Yahya bin Hassan hain, Lais bin Sa'd se, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah se."
"1650","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us janeen ke bare mein jo apni maan ke pet mein qatl kiya jaye, ghulam ya waleedah ke ghurran ka faisla farmaya. To jis par faisla kiya gaya tha us ne kaha: Main us ka jurmana kaise dun jo na piye aur na khaye aur na bole aur na cheekhe, aur us jaisa zaya hai? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh kahinon ke bhaiyon mein se hai."
"1651","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr se, Tawus se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Main Allah ki yaad dilata hun us mard ko jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se janeen ke bare mein kuch suna ho? To Hamal bin Malik bin Nabighah khade hue aur bole: Main apni do padosinon ke darmiyan tha; un mein se ek ne doosri ko mistah se mara, to us ne murda janeen gira diya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein ghurran ka faisla farmaya. To Umar ne farmaya: Qareeb tha ke hum is jaisi mein apni rae se faisla karte."
"1652","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar aur Ibn Tawus se, Tawus se: Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Main Allah ki yaad dilata hun us mard ko jis ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se janeen ke bare mein kuch suna ho. To Hamal bin Malik bin Nabighah khade hue aur bole: Main apni do padosinon ke darmiyan tha, yani do sauton ke darmiyan, un mein se ek ne doosri ko mistah se mara aur us ne murda janeen gira diya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein ghurran ka faisla farmaya. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Agar hum ne yeh na suna hota to hum us mein is ke siva faisla karte. Pehli Kitab Jirahul Amd se, doosri Kitab Diyat wal Qisas se, teesri aur chauthi Kitab Jirahul Khata se, aur paanchwin Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1653","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ibn Musayyab se: Unhon ne farmaya: Ghulam ki aql us ki qeemat mein hai."
"1654","[AI-translation] Yahya bin Hassan ne hamein khabar di, Lais bin Sa'd se, Zuhri se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Unhon ne farmaya: Ghulam ki aql us ki qeemat mein hai jaise aazad ke zakhm us ki diyat mein. Aur Ibn Shihab ne farmaya: Aur un ke siva mardon ne farmaya: Use tijarat ka maal qarar diya jayega. Dono hadeesein Kitab Said waz Zabaih se nikali."
"1655","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Sadaqah bin Yasar se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Sa'id bin Musayyab ki taraf bheja un se mu'ahid ki diyat ke bare mein poochte hue. To unhon ne farmaya: Us mein Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne chaar hazaar ka faisla farmaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir hum ne kaha: Phir use kis ne qatl kiya? Unhon ne farmaya: Phir unhon ne hum par kankariyan phenkin. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Yahi woh hain jinhon ne un se aakhir mein poocha."
"1656","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Sadaqah bin Yasar se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ne Sa'id bin Musayyab ki taraf bheja un se Yahudi aur Nasrani ki diyat ke bare mein poochte hue. To Sa'id ne farmaya: Us mein Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne chaar hazaar ka faisla farmaya."
"1657","[AI-translation] Fuzail bin Iyaz ne hamein khabar di, Mansoor se, Sabit se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Unhon ne Yahudi aur Nasrani mein chaar hazaar ka, aur Majoosi mein aath sau ka faisla farmaya. Pehli Kitab Diyat wal Qisas se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Siyar ala Siyar Waqidi se, aur woh us mein aakhri hain."
"1658","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, apne walid (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Us kitab mein jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ke liye likhi: Aur naak mein jab poori kaat di jaye sau oont, aur mamoomah mein jaan ka teesra, aur jaifah mein usi jaisa, aur aankh mein pachaas, aur hath mein pachaas, aur paon mein pachaas, aur un mein se har ungli mein das oont, aur daant mein paanch, aur moozihah mein paanch."
"1659","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm se, apne walid se: Us kitab mein jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ke liye likhi: Aur un mein se har ungli mein das oont."
"1660","[AI-translation] Ismail Ibn Ulaiyah ne hamein apni sanad se khabar di, Abu Musa se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ungliyon mein das das."
"1661","[AI-translation] Sufyan aur Abdul Wahhab Saqafi ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne angoothe mein pandrah ka, aur jo us ke baad hai us mein das ka, aur darmiyani mein das ka, aur jo chhoti ke baad hai us mein nau ka, aur chhoti mein chhe ka faisla farmaya."
"1662","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Zaid bin Aslam se, Muslim bin Jundab se, Aslam maula Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne daadh mein ek oont ka, hansi mein ek oont ka, aur pasli mein ek oont ka faisla farmaya."
"1663","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Hasan ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne bataya: Dawood bin Husain ne bataya: Abu Ghatfan bin Tarif Muzani ne unhein khabar di ke Marwan bin Hakam ne unhein Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf bheja daadh ke bare mein poochte hue? To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Us mein paanch oont hain. To Marwan ne mujhe Ibn Abbas ki taraf wapas bheja. To unhon ne farmaya: Kya tum munh ke agle hisse ko daadhon jaisa karte ho? To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Agar tum is ka etibar na karo magar ungliyon se, un ki aql barabar hai. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Yeh us mein se hai jo dalalat karta hai ke dono honthon ki aql barabar hai. Aur dono honthon mein is ke siva aasar aaye hain. Pehli Kitab Jirahul Khata se, doosri aur teesri Kitab Jirahul Amd se, chauthi Kitab Risalah se, paanchwin Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur chhathi aur Shafi'i ke qaul Kitab Diyat wal Qisas se nikali."
"1664","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, apne walid se: Us kitab mein jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ke liye likhi: Aur moozihah mein paanch."
"1665","[AI-translation] Siqah ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Haris se, agar main ne use Abdullah se nahin suna, Malik bin Anas se, Yazid bin Qusait se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Umar aur Usman (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne miltah mein moozihah ki diyat ke aadhe ka faisla farmaya."
"1666","[AI-translation] Muslim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Sauri se, Malik se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se, Ibn Musayyab se, Umar aur Usman se usi ki tarah."
"1667","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne farmaya: Mujhe us ne khabar di jis ne Ibn Nafi' ko Malik se is sanad se usi ki tarah zikr karte suna. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur hum ne Malik par padha: Hum qadeem aur jadeed mein se kisi imam ko nahin jante jis ne moozihah se kam mein kisi cheez ka faisla farmaya ho. Pehli Kitab Jirahul Amd se, aur chauthi ke aakhir tak aur Shafi'i ke qaul Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1668","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab aur Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maweshi ka zakhm muaf hai. Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
